<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Agnico-Eagle begun.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Agnico-Eagle begun.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said on Thursday it started coverage of the shares of Agnico-Eagle Mines Ltd with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- &quot;In the midst of the current depressed gold price environment, the company benefits from its low-cost structure, strong balance sheet and the likely acceleration of gold reserve additions now that the third shaft at La Ronde has accessed the new zones and reserve drilling can be intensified,&quot; analyst Leanne Baker said in a research note.</p>
<p>-- The stock last traded at C$12.80 in Toronto.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
